1..18
ok 1 - @array = ($arrayitem,) does not flatten the arrayitem
ok 2 - @array = ($arrayitem) does not flatten the arrayitem
ok 3 - @array = $arrayitem does not flatten the arrayitem
ok 4 - %hash = ($hashitem,) does not flatten the hashitem
ok 5 - %hash = ($hashitem,) does not flatten the hashitem
ok 6 - %hash = $hashitem works due to single argument rule
ok 7 - $bar = ($foo,) does not flatten the arrayitem
ok 8 - $bar = ($foo) does flatten the arrayitem
ok 9 - $bar = $foo does flatten the arrayitem
ok 10 - $bar = ($foo,) does not flatten the hashitem
ok 11 - $bar = ($foo) does flatten the hashitem
ok 12 - $bar = $foo does flatten the hashitem
ok 13 - @array[0] = ($arrayitem,) does not flatten the arrayitem
ok 14 - @array[0] = ($arrayitem) does not flatten the arrayitem
ok 15 - @array[0] = $arrayitem does not flatten the arrayitem
ok 16 - %hash<a> = ($hashitem,) does not flatten the hashitem
ok 17 - %hash<a> = ($hashitem) does not flatten the hashitem
ok 18 - %hash<a> = $hashitem does not flatten the hashitem
